1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,008
Tetemeko la ardhi, sivyo? Video ya leo ni nini? Ni kuhusu tahadhari za majanga.

2
00:00:10,008 --> 00:00:11,508
Sehemu ya 1: Tetemeko la ardhi Kyushu / Tetemeko la ardhi Kyushu

3
00:00:11,508 --> 00:00:13,641
Habari za asubuhi.

4
00:00:13,665 --> 00:00:16,149
Habari za asubuhi.

5
00:00:16,172 --> 00:00:19,790
Umeangalia habari za televisheni leo asubuhi?

6
00:00:19,813 --> 00:00:23,447
Hapana, sijawaona bado.

7
00:00:23,470 --> 00:00:26,036
Kuna kitu kilitokea?

8
00:00:26,059 --> 00:00:31,143
Asubuhi hii kulikuwa na tetemeko kubwa la ardhi Kyushu.

9
00:00:31,167 --> 00:00:34,001
Aa, kweli?

10
00:00:34,024 --> 00:00:36,399
Ilitokea saa ngapi?

11
00:00:36,422 --> 00:00:39,556
Saa kumi na mbili za asubuhi (6:00 asubuhi).

12
00:00:39,579 --> 00:00:43,379
Mimi nilikuwa nikilala wakati huo.

13
00:00:43,401 --> 00:00:46,484
Hapa hatukutetemeka, sivyo?

14
00:00:46,508 --> 00:00:50,575
Ndiyo, hapa tulikuwa salama.

15
00:00:50,598 --> 00:00:53,849
Tetemeko la ardhi Kyushu lilikuwa kubwa?

16
00:00:53,872 --> 00:00:58,146
Ndiyo, lilikuwa kubwa sana.

17
00:00:58,170 --> 00:01:00,981
Kuna watu waliojeruhiwa?

18
00:01:01,005 --> 00:01:05,972
Ndiyo, kwenye habari kulikuwa na mwanamke aliyekuwa akilia.

19
00:01:05,996 --> 00:01:08,729
Hiyo ni mbaya sana.

20
00:01:08,752 --> 00:01:11,602
Mji ulikuwa salama?

21
00:01:11,626 --> 00:01:15,393
Nyumba za zamani zilivunjika kidogo.

22
00:01:15,416 --> 00:01:19,749
Ndiyo hiyo. Je, kulikuwa na tsunami?

23
00:01:19,772 --> 00:01:23,972
Hapana, tsunami haikuja.

24
00:01:23,995 --> 00:01:26,628
Aa, ni vizuri.

25
00:01:26,651 --> 00:01:30,549
Nchini Japani tetemeko la ardhi ni mengi sana, sivyo?

26
00:01:30,573 --> 00:01:33,906
Mimi ninaogopa daima.

27
00:01:33,929 --> 00:01:37,420
Ndiyo, Japani mara nyingi hutetemeka.

28
00:01:37,444 --> 00:01:42,417
Asubuhi hii niliwatahadharisha familia yangu nchini kwangu.

29
00:01:42,440 --> 00:01:45,646
Familia yako iliwaogopa?

30
00:01:45,669 --> 00:01:49,436
Ndiyo, walikuwa na wasiwasi mkubwa.

31
00:01:49,459 --> 00:01:51,525
Ndiyo, ni hivi.

32
00:01:51,548 --> 00:01:54,482
Una marafiki Kyushu?

33
00:01:54,505 --> 00:01:57,505
Hapana, sina.

34
00:01:57,528 --> 00:02:01,661
Mimi nina rafiki wa chuo kikuu anayeishi Kyushu.

35
00:02:01,684 --> 00:02:03,650
Yuko salama?

36
00:02:03,673 --> 00:02:06,446
Unataka kumpigia simu mara moja?

37
00:02:06,470 --> 00:02:10,365
Ndiyo, nitamtumia barua pekee baadaye.

38
00:02:10,388 --> 00:02:19,397
Skripu ya video ya leo inapatikana kwenye maelezo na maoni ya juu kwa kupakua. Tafadhali tunaomba utoe maoni yako kabla ya kupakua.

39
00:02:19,397 --> 00:02:20,897
Sehemu ya 2: Pumziko na Amani / Pumziko na Amani

40
00:02:20,897 --> 00:02:23,190
Umechoka, asante.

41
00:02:23,213 --> 00:02:25,284
Tupumzike kidogo.

42
00:02:25,307 --> 00:02:27,787
Ndiyo, fanya hivyo.

43
00:02:27,811 --> 00:02:30,244
Unataka kahawa?

44
00:02:30,268 --> 00:02:32,753
Ndiyo, nitakunywa.

45
00:02:32,776 --> 00:02:35,343
Asante kwa kila wakati.

46
00:02:35,366 --> 00:02:39,499
Tetemeko la ardhi Kyushu leo asubuhi lilikuwa kubwa, sivyo?

47
00:02:39,522 --> 00:02:43,408
Ndiyo, lilikuwa kubwa sana.

48
00:02:43,432 --> 00:02:46,299
Nilishangaa nilipoangalia habari.

49
00:02:46,322 --> 00:02:50,014
Una familia au marafiki Kyushu?

50
00:02:50,037 --> 00:02:54,372
Ndiyo, wazazi wangu wanaishi Kyushu.

51
00:02:54,395 --> 00:02:57,239
Aa, wazazi wako?

52
00:02:57,262 --> 00:02:59,801
Umewahi kupiga simu?

53
00:02:59,824 --> 00:03:03,429
Ndiyo, nilipiga simu mapema asubuhi.

54
00:03:03,453 --> 00:03:06,419
Wazazi wako walikuwa salama?

55
00:03:06,442 --> 00:03:09,176
Ndiyo, walikuwa salama.

56
00:03:09,198 --> 00:03:11,532
Wote wawili walikuwa wenye nguvu.

57
00:03:11,555 --> 00:03:15,121
Haya, ni vizuri kusikia.

58
00:03:15,144 --> 00:03:18,811
Ndiyo, nilipata raha baada ya kusikia sauti zao.

59
00:03:18,834 --> 00:03:22,367
Wazazi wako hawakuumia?

60
00:03:22,390 --> 00:03:25,678
Ndiyo, hawakuumia.

61
00:03:25,702 --> 00:03:28,702
Nyumbani pia kulikuwa salama?

62
00:03:28,725 --> 00:03:31,525
Sahani chache zilivunjika.

63
00:03:31,548 --> 00:03:35,281
Lakini hakukuwa na matatizo makubwa.

64
00:03:35,304 --> 00:03:39,504
Haya, maji na chakula zipo?

65
00:03:39,527 --> 00:03:42,102
Ndiyo, zipo kwa wingi.

66
00:03:42,125 --> 00:03:45,742
Wazazi wangu daima huwa na maji tayari.

67
00:03:45,766 --> 00:03:48,173
Hiyo ni nzuri sana.

68
00:03:48,196 --> 00:03:50,069
Ni raha kusikia.

69
00:03:50,093 --> 00:03:53,873
Lakini mama alikuwa amechoka kidogo.

70
00:03:53,896 --> 00:03:56,935
Usiku pia hakulala vizuri.

71
00:03:56,958 --> 00:04:01,492
Ndiyo, wakati wa tetemeko la ardhi mtu huchoka.

72
00:04:01,515 --> 00:04:05,090
Eeh, nilikuwa na wasiwasi sana.

73
00:04:05,113 --> 00:04:09,379
Umewahi kuwasiliana na marafiki wako wa karibu?

74
00:04:09,402 --> 00:04:12,672
Ndiyo, marafiki pia walikuwa salama.

75
00:04:12,696 --> 00:04:14,263
Ni vizuri kusikia.

76
00:04:14,286 --> 00:04:17,303
Familia yangu iko Tokyo.

77
00:04:17,326 --> 00:04:20,770
Tokyo pia tetemeko la ardhi hutokea mara kwa mara, sivyo?

78
00:04:20,794 --> 00:04:25,474
Ndiyo. Kwa hiyo, nitawapigia simu baadaye.

79
00:04:25,497 --> 00:04:28,097
Ndiyo, hiyo ni bora.

80
00:04:28,120 --> 00:04:30,413
Nimeona habari.

81
00:04:30,437 --> 00:04:33,416
Kyuushuu kutakuwa na mvua siku zijazo.

82
00:04:33,439 --> 00:04:35,849
Aa, kweli?

83
00:04:35,873 --> 00:04:38,144
Hiyo ni hatari.

84
00:04:38,168 --> 00:04:41,168
Ndiyo, nina wasiwasi sana.

85
00:04:41,191 --> 00:04:44,470
Nitawatumia ujumbe wazazi wangu usiku huu.

86
00:04:44,494 --> 00:04:47,027
Ndiyo, fanya hivyo.

87
00:04:47,050 --> 00:04:54,155
Kiungo cha tovuti ambapo unaweza kukagua video ya leo kipo kwenye maelezo na maoni ya juu. *Tovuti inaweza kufutwa bila tahadhari.

88
00:04:54,155 --> 00:04:55,655
Sehemu ya 3: Jinsi ya Kulinda Nafsi Wakati wa Tetemeko la Ardhi

89
00:04:55,655 --> 00:05:01,934
Kama tetemeko kubwa lingetokea sasa, ungekuwa unafanya nini?

90
00:05:01,958 --> 00:05:06,625
Eeh, ningeenda haraka nje.

91
00:05:06,648 --> 00:05:09,181
Hiyo ni hatari.

92
00:05:09,204 --> 00:05:12,405
Usirushie kwenda nje kwa haraka.

93
00:05:12,428 --> 00:05:14,100
Haya, ninaelewa.

94
00:05:14,124 --> 00:05:17,813
Kama ungekuwa ndani ya chumba ungekuwa unafanya nini?

95
00:05:17,836 --> 00:05:21,474
Kwanza, jilinde kichwa.

96
00:05:21,497 --> 00:05:23,497
Sawa, nimeelewa.

97
00:05:23,520 --> 00:05:27,120
Tumia begi au mto wa kupumzika kulinda kichwa.

98
00:05:27,144 --> 00:05:31,838
Kisha, ingia chini ya meza mara moja.

99
00:05:31,862 --> 00:05:34,695
Chini ya meza, sivyo?

100
00:05:34,718 --> 00:05:36,156
Sawa, nimeelewa.

101
00:05:36,180 --> 00:05:40,460
Shika miguu ya meza vizuri.

102
00:05:40,484 --> 00:05:41,567
Sawa.

103
00:05:41,591 --> 00:05:44,801
Unangoja hadi tetemeko likome?

104
00:05:44,824 --> 00:05:47,304
Ndiyo, ndivyo.

105
00:05:47,327 --> 00:05:51,061
Baada ya mitetemo kuisha, zima moto.

106
00:05:51,084 --> 00:05:54,851
Unapokuwa ukitayarisha chakula, unafanya nini?

107
00:05:54,874 --> 00:05:57,912
Je, unazima moto mara moja?

108
00:05:57,935 --> 00:06:02,738
Mitetemo mikubwa ni hatari karibu na moto.

109
00:06:02,761 --> 00:06:05,761
Bas, lini unapaswa kuzima moto?

110
00:06:05,784 --> 00:06:10,017
Baada ya mitetemo kuisha, zima moto.

111
00:06:10,040 --> 00:06:11,607
Sawa, nimeelewa.

112
00:06:11,630 --> 00:06:15,163
Kwanza, jilinde mwenyewe.

113
00:06:15,186 --> 00:06:17,043
Ndiyo.

114
00:06:17,067 --> 00:06:20,906
Kisha, fungua mlango wa chumba.

115
00:06:20,929 --> 00:06:23,900
Kwa nini unahitaji kufungua mlango?

116
00:06:23,923 --> 00:06:28,257
Baada ya tetemeko la ardhi, mlango unaweza kukataa kufunguka.

117
00:06:28,280 --> 00:06:30,013
Nimeelewa.

118
00:06:30,036 --> 00:06:33,048
Unaunda njia ya kukimbia, basi.

119
00:06:33,072 --> 00:06:34,682
Ndiyo.

120
00:06:34,705 --> 00:06:39,072
Kisha, usikaribie karibu na dirisha.

121
00:06:39,095 --> 00:06:41,895
Kwa sababu glasi inaweza kuvunjika.

122
00:06:41,918 --> 00:06:43,416
Sawa.

123
00:06:43,439 --> 00:06:46,039
Ondoka mbali na dirisha.

124
00:06:46,062 --> 00:06:47,865
Sawa, nimeelewa.

125
00:06:47,888 --> 00:06:50,971
Viatu vako unaziweka wapi?

126
00:06:50,995 --> 00:06:55,668
Weka viatu au vipande karibu na kitanda chako.

127
00:06:55,691 --> 00:06:59,458
Kwa sababu kunaweza kuwa na vipande vya glasi ndani ya chumba.

128
00:06:59,481 --> 00:07:00,914
Sawa.

129
00:07:00,937 --> 00:07:03,385
Linda miguu yako.

130
00:07:03,409 --> 00:07:07,814
Usiku huu nitawaweka viatu karibu na kitanda.

131
00:07:07,837 --> 00:07:11,204
Weka pia simu yako karibu.

132
00:07:11,227 --> 00:07:12,827
Sawa.

133
00:07:12,850 --> 00:07:17,109
Usiku ni giza, kwa hiyo tutatumia taa ya simu.

134
00:07:17,132 --> 00:07:19,911
Hiyo ni nzuri sana.

135
00:07:19,935 --> 00:07:23,226
Kuthibitisha sheria za tetemeko la ardhi ni muhimu.

136
00:07:23,250 --> 00:07:24,983
Sawa.

137
00:07:25,006 --> 00:07:28,651
Washa mara kwa mara tuzichunguze pamoja.

138
00:07:28,674 --> 00:07:30,247
Sawa.

139
00:07:30,270 --> 00:07:31,759
Hivyo ndivyo tutakavyofanya.

140
00:07:31,783 --> 00:07:33,283
Sehemu ya 4: Kupanga Chumba na Usalama wa Rafu ya Vitabu

141
00:07:33,283 --> 00:07:36,449
Chumba chako kipya kinaendelea vipi?

142
00:07:36,472 --> 00:07:39,472
Ni pana sana.

143
00:07:39,495 --> 00:07:42,729
Napenda chumba hiki.

144
00:07:42,752 --> 00:07:46,885
Umekwisha kupanga vitu baada ya kuhamia?

145
00:07:46,908 --> 00:07:50,154
Ndiyo, karibu kumaliza.

146
00:07:50,177 --> 00:07:52,711
Asante kwa leo.

147
00:07:52,734 --> 00:07:57,940
Asante. Rafu hiyo ya vitabu ni refu sana, sivyo?

148
00:07:57,963 --> 00:08:03,011
Ndiyo, nina vitabu vingi.

149
00:08:03,035 --> 00:08:07,368
Rafu ya vitabu iko karibu sana na kitanda.

150
00:08:07,391 --> 00:08:12,594
Ndiyo, ninasoma kitabu kila usiku kabla ya kulala.

151
00:08:12,618 --> 00:08:15,951
Hiyo ni hatari kidogo.

152
00:08:15,974 --> 00:08:17,832
Kwa nini?

153
00:08:17,856 --> 00:08:22,698
Tetemeko kubwa la ardhi linaweza kuleta rafu ya vitabu kuzama.

154
00:08:22,722 --> 00:08:24,955
Aa, ndivyo.

155
00:08:24,978 --> 00:08:30,229
Inaweza kuanguka juu ya kitanda, na hiyo ni hatari sana.

156
00:08:30,253 --> 00:08:33,219
Hiyo ni ya kutisha.

157
00:08:33,242 --> 00:08:35,499
Tutafanyeje?

158
00:08:35,523 --> 00:08:39,557
Kwanza, tugeuke mahali pa rafu ya vitabu.

159
00:08:39,580 --> 00:08:42,546
Sawa. Mahali gani ni bora?

160
00:08:42,569 --> 00:08:46,236
Karibu na ukuta pale, je, vipi?

161
00:08:46,259 --> 00:08:48,192
Nzuri sana.

162
00:08:48,215 --> 00:08:50,487
Tuweke hapa.

163
00:08:50,510 --> 00:08:55,144
Halafu, tuamame kabati vizuri kwenye ukuta.

164
00:08:55,167 --> 00:08:58,133
Tutafanya nini ili kuifunga kwenye ukuta?

165
00:08:58,156 --> 00:09:02,356
Kuna zana maalum kwa ajili ya tetemeko la ardhi.

166
00:09:02,379 --> 00:09:04,439
Haya, ninaelewa.

167
00:09:04,463 --> 00:09:07,334
Zana hizo ziko wapi?

168
00:09:07,357 --> 00:09:10,240
Zipo katika duka la karibu.

169
00:09:10,264 --> 00:09:12,832
Bei yake ni ghali?

170
00:09:12,855 --> 00:09:15,937
Hapana, ni rahisi.

171
00:09:15,961 --> 00:09:18,127
Inagharimu kama elfu moja ya kyenye.

172
00:09:18,150 --> 00:09:20,841
Hiyo ni nzuri.

173
00:09:20,865 --> 00:09:25,198
Sasa hivi twende pamoja dukani kununua.

174
00:09:25,221 --> 00:09:27,454
Ndiyo, twende.

175
00:09:27,477 --> 00:09:30,644
Je, una samani nyingine kubwa?

176
00:09:30,667 --> 00:09:33,900
Pia televisheni ni kubwa kidogo.

177
00:09:33,923 --> 00:09:38,211
Basi, tutununue pia zana za televisheni.

178
00:09:38,235 --> 00:09:40,124
Sawa, nimeelewa.

179
00:09:40,147 --> 00:09:44,680
Vitu vizito vya kabati viwe chini.

180
00:09:44,703 --> 00:09:48,138
Je, tutaweka nini juu?

181
00:09:48,162 --> 00:09:51,095
Weke vitu vyepesi juu.

182
00:09:51,118 --> 00:09:52,851
Sawa, nimeelewa.

183
00:09:52,874 --> 00:09:57,246
Maandalizi ya tetemeko la ardhi ni muhimu sana, kweli.

184
00:09:57,270 --> 00:10:00,961
Ndiyo, leo tutafanya yote pamoja.

185
00:10:00,985 --> 00:10:04,385
Ndiyo, naomba unisaidie.

186
00:10:04,408 --> 00:10:05,908
Mstari wa 5: Kuandaa Mfuko wa Dharura

187
00:10:05,908 --> 00:10:08,797
Unafanya nini?

188
00:10:08,820 --> 00:10:13,304
Ninaandaa rucksack ya dharura.

189
00:10:13,327 --> 00:10:16,527
Hii ni mfuko kwa ajili ya tetemeko la ardhi, sivyo?

190
00:10:16,550 --> 00:10:19,183
Ndiyo, ndivyo.

191
00:10:19,206 --> 00:10:22,740
Leo nitachunguza yaliyomo ndani yake.

192
00:10:22,763 --> 00:10:26,938
Kuna nini ndani ya mfuko?

193
00:10:26,961 --> 00:10:30,599
Kuna maji na chakula.

194
00:10:30,623 --> 00:10:33,656
Maji yako ni kiasi gani?

195
00:10:33,679 --> 00:10:38,812
Kuna chupa tatu za maji ya nusu lita.

196
00:10:38,835 --> 00:10:42,049
Chakula ni nini?

197
00:10:42,073 --> 00:10:47,140
Ni mkate na chokoleti ambazo zinaweza kuhifadhiwa kwa muda mrefu.

198
00:10:47,163 --> 00:10:49,396
Chokoleti ni nzuri.

199
00:10:49,419 --> 00:10:52,236
Kuna nini kingine?

200
00:10:52,259 --> 00:10:55,826
Kuna taulo na nguo.

201
00:10:55,849 --> 00:10:58,582
Je, una tochi?

202
00:10:58,605 --> 00:11:01,481
Ndiyo, hii ipo hapa.

203
00:11:01,505 --> 00:11:04,305
Beteri ni mpya?

204
00:11:04,328 --> 00:11:08,534
Aa, beteri ni kidogo ya zamani.

205
00:11:08,557 --> 00:11:13,032
Basi, ni bora uweke beteri mpya.

206
00:11:13,056 --> 00:11:14,823
Ndiyo, ni hivi.

207
00:11:14,846 --> 00:11:18,612
Nitununua beteri mpya baadaye.

208
00:11:18,635 --> 00:11:20,969
Je, una redio pia?

209
00:11:20,991 --> 00:11:24,559
Ndiyo, kuna redio ndogo.

210
00:11:24,583 --> 00:11:28,156
Chaji ya simu ni muhimu pia, sivyo?

211
00:11:28,179 --> 00:11:31,912
Ndiyo, nitaweka pia betri ya simu ya mkononi.

212
00:11:31,935 --> 00:11:35,190
Je, una dawa na plasta?

213
00:11:35,214 --> 00:11:38,414
Hapana, sijaziweka bado.

214
00:11:38,437 --> 00:11:43,570
Ni vizuri kuwa na dawa kwa ajili ya majeraha.

215
00:11:43,593 --> 00:11:45,567
Sawa, nimeelewa.

216
00:11:45,591 --> 00:11:49,191
Nitakwenda dukani kununua dawa kesho.

217
00:11:49,214 --> 00:11:51,547
Mfuko ni mzito?

218
00:11:51,570 --> 00:11:56,241
Ni mzito kidogo, lakini naweza kukimbia.

219
00:11:56,265 --> 00:11:59,298
Unaweka mfuko wapi?

220
00:11:59,321 --> 00:12:02,188
Nitaweka karibu na ingia ya nyumbani.

221
00:12:02,211 --> 00:12:06,065
Ni vizuri kwa sababu unaweza kukimbia haraka.

222
00:12:06,089 --> 00:12:11,655
Ndiyo. Je, nyumbani kwako una mfuko wa dharura?

223
00:12:11,678 --> 00:12:15,413
Hapana, sijajiandaa bado.

224
00:12:15,437 --> 00:12:20,437
Nchini Japani kuna tetemeko la ardhi mara kwa mara, basi jiandae.

225
00:12:20,460 --> 00:12:24,460
Ndiyo, nitajiandaa mwishoni mwa wiki hii.

226
00:12:24,483 --> 00:12:29,049
Kuna mifuko mizuri ya dharura katika duka la karibu.

227
00:12:29,072 --> 00:12:33,439
Basi, unaweza kunionyesha duka hilo siku ya Jumapili?

228
00:12:33,462 --> 00:12:36,495
Ndiyo, twende pamoja.

229
00:12:36,518 --> 00:12:38,018
Sehemu ya 6: Maandalizi ya Dharura: Kupata Maji

230
00:12:38,018 --> 00:12:42,874
Hii ndiyo sehemu ya vifaa vya dharura katika duka, sivyo?

231
00:12:42,897 --> 00:12:47,169
Ndiyo, kuna vitu vingi hapa.

232
00:12:47,193 --> 00:12:51,040
Kwanza, tununue maji.

233
00:12:51,064 --> 00:12:52,864
Ndiyo, ni hivi.

234
00:12:52,887 --> 00:12:56,487
Maji ni muhimu zaidi.

235
00:12:56,510 --> 00:13:00,277
Unahitaji maji kiasi gani?

236
00:13:00,300 --> 00:13:05,571
Mtu mmoja anahitaji lita tatu kwa siku.

237
00:13:05,595 --> 00:13:07,574
Haya, ninaelewa.

238
00:13:07,597 --> 00:13:11,131
Unanunua maji ya siku ngapi?

239
00:13:11,154 --> 00:13:14,987
Ni bora kununua maji ya siku tatu.

240
00:13:15,010 --> 00:13:19,143
Basi, ni lita tisa kwa mtu mmoja.

241
00:13:19,166 --> 00:13:23,933
Ndiyo, kwa watu wawili ni lita kumi na nane.

242
00:13:23,956 --> 00:13:26,889
Lita kumi na nane?

243
00:13:26,912 --> 00:13:29,989
Hiyo ni nzito sana!

244
00:13:30,013 --> 00:13:34,379
Leo nimekuja na gari, basi hakuna tatizo.

245
00:13:34,402 --> 00:13:36,436
Ni vizuri kusikia.

246
00:13:36,459 --> 00:13:39,725
Basi, tutaweka haya kwenye gari.

247
00:13:39,748 --> 00:13:42,548
Baadae ni chakula.

248
00:13:42,571 --> 00:13:46,105
Ni bora kununua chakula kinachoweza kusimama kwa muda mrefu.

249
00:13:46,127 --> 00:13:48,294
Tununue nini?

250
00:13:48,317 --> 00:13:51,357
Je, makopo yanatosha?

251
00:13:51,381 --> 00:13:53,114
Nzuri sana.

252
00:13:53,137 --> 00:13:55,393
Tununue mengi.

253
00:13:55,417 --> 00:13:59,150
Aa, hata makopo ya mkate yapo.

254
00:13:59,173 --> 00:14:00,340
Eeh?

255
00:14:00,363 --> 00:14:03,541
Kuna mkate ndani ya makopo?

256
00:14:03,564 --> 00:14:07,498
Ndiyo, ni tamu sana.

257
00:14:07,521 --> 00:14:09,722
Ni jambo la ajabu!

258
00:14:09,745 --> 00:14:12,035
Tununue hii pia.

259
00:14:12,059 --> 00:14:16,325
Ni bora kununua chakula cha siku tatu.

260
00:14:16,348 --> 00:14:18,148
Sawa, nimeelewa.

261
00:14:18,171 --> 00:14:20,705
Kuna hata karai.

262
00:14:20,728 --> 00:14:25,814
Je, unaweza kula bila kupasha moto?

263
00:14:25,838 --> 00:14:29,471
Ndiyo, imeandikwa kwenye kifuniko.

264
00:14:29,494 --> 00:14:31,538
Ni rahisi sana!

265
00:14:31,561 --> 00:14:33,828
Tununue hiyo pia.

266
00:14:33,851 --> 00:14:37,855
Oo, ni vizuri kununua pia kidogo cha vitamu.

267
00:14:37,878 --> 00:14:40,045
Chokoleti?

268
00:14:40,067 --> 00:14:45,201
Ndiyo, wakati wa uchovu, kitu kitamu ni bora.

269
00:14:45,224 --> 00:14:46,990
Nimeelewa.

270
00:14:47,013 --> 00:14:50,461
Basi, nitanunua chokoleti na peremende.

271
00:14:50,485 --> 00:14:54,052
Kuna vitu vingine vinavyohitajika?

272
00:14:54,075 --> 00:14:58,241
Je, tununue sahani na glasi za karatasi?

273
00:14:58,264 --> 00:15:00,333
Nzuri sana.

274
00:15:00,356 --> 00:15:03,399
Huu ni muhimu wakati maji yanaposimama.

275
00:15:03,423 --> 00:15:07,225
Ndiyo, kwa sababu haitakubidi kusafisha.

276
00:15:07,249 --> 00:15:11,182
Basi, twende tuangalie rafu pale.

277
00:15:11,205 --> 00:15:14,019
Ndiyo, twende.

278
00:15:14,043 --> 00:15:15,543
Mstari wa 7: Mazungumzo kuhusu Mahali pa kujificha / Utangulizi wa Maeneo ya Kujificha

279
00:15:15,543 --> 00:15:19,209
Leo hali ya hewa ni nzuri, sivyo?

280
00:15:19,232 --> 00:15:23,566
Ndiyo, ni siku nzuri kwa kutembea.

281
00:15:23,589 --> 00:15:29,222
Aa, kuna bango la kijani pale.

282
00:15:29,245 --> 00:15:31,279
Ni kweli.

283
00:15:31,303 --> 00:15:34,269
Kimeandikwa nini?

284
00:15:34,292 --> 00:15:37,585
Kimeandikwa "Mahali pa kujificha".

285
00:15:37,609 --> 00:15:40,243
Mahali pa kujificha?

286
00:15:40,266 --> 00:15:42,666
Ni nini hicho?

287
00:15:42,688 --> 00:15:47,888
Ni pahali ambapo watu hukutana wakati wa tetemeko la ardhi kubwa.

288
00:15:47,911 --> 00:15:50,278
Haya, ninaelewa.

289
00:15:50,301 --> 00:15:52,745
Hapa ni bustani, sivyo?

290
00:15:52,769 --> 00:15:58,775
Ndiyo, bustani hii ni pana na salama.

291
00:15:58,798 --> 00:16:03,836
Karibu na nyumbani kwangu kuna bango sawa na hili.

292
00:16:03,859 --> 00:16:06,863
Zana hizo ziko wapi?

293
00:16:06,887 --> 00:16:10,820
Lipo mbele ya shule ya msingi iliyo karibu.

294
00:16:10,843 --> 00:16:14,684
Shule ya msingi pia ni mahali pa kujificha, sivyo?

295
00:16:14,707 --> 00:16:19,949
Ndiyo. Wakati wa tetemeko la ardhi, naenda shule hiyo.

296
00:16:19,973 --> 00:16:23,412
Hiyo ni salama sana.

297
00:16:23,436 --> 00:16:29,494
Lakini usiku ni giza, naona wasiwasi kidogo.

298
00:16:29,517 --> 00:16:34,170
Karibu na bustani hii kuna barabara kubwa.

299
00:16:34,193 --> 00:16:38,242
Ndiyo, barabara hiyo ni angavu.

300
00:16:38,265 --> 00:16:43,332
Wakati wa tetemeko la ardhi, tembea barabara angavu hiyo.

301
00:16:43,355 --> 00:16:45,569
Sawa, nimeelewa.

302
00:16:45,592 --> 00:16:48,398
Usitembee barabarani penye giza.

303
00:16:48,421 --> 00:16:52,193
Umeangalia ramani karibu na nyumbani kwako?

304
00:16:52,217 --> 00:16:54,750
Ramani?

305
00:16:54,773 --> 00:16:58,352
Hapana, sijawaona bado.

306
00:16:58,376 --> 00:17:02,976
Kwenye tovuti ya mji kuna ramani ya hatari.

307
00:17:02,998 --> 00:17:06,452
Ramani ya hatari ni nini?

308
00:17:06,476 --> 00:17:10,443
Ni ramani inayoonyesha maeneo yenye hatari.

309
00:17:10,466 --> 00:17:13,399
Hiyo ni muhimu sana.

310
00:17:13,422 --> 00:17:17,556
Baadaye tutaangalia ramani hiyo pamoja.

311
00:17:17,579 --> 00:17:20,869
Ndiyo, naomba sana.

312
00:17:20,893 --> 00:17:25,426
Basi, twende tukitembee kidogo mjini.

313
00:17:25,449 --> 00:17:27,182
Ndiyo, ni hivi.

314
00:17:27,205 --> 00:17:30,422
Tutaangalia mabango mengine pia.

315
00:17:30,446 --> 00:17:33,012
Ndiyo, twende.

316
00:17:33,035 --> 00:17:34,535
Mstari wa 8: Maandalizi ya Dharura / Kujiandaa kwa Majanga

317
00:17:34,535 --> 00:17:37,231
Unafanya nini?

318
00:17:37,255 --> 00:17:42,424
Ninachaji betri ya simu yangu ya mkononi.

319
00:17:42,448 --> 00:17:45,115
Betri ya simu ya mkononi?

320
00:17:45,138 --> 00:17:47,305
Kwa nini?

321
00:17:47,328 --> 00:17:52,695
Wakati wa tetemeko la ardhi, umeme unaweza kusimama.

322
00:17:52,718 --> 00:17:56,451
Aa, wakati wa giza la umeme.

323
00:17:56,474 --> 00:18:02,474
Ndiyo. Umeme ukisimama, huwezi kuchaji simu yako.

324
00:18:02,497 --> 00:18:06,064
Hiyo ni tatizo kubwa.

325
00:18:06,086 --> 00:18:10,184
Ndiyo, kwa sababu huwezi kuwasiliana na familia.

326
00:18:10,208 --> 00:18:13,975
Hata habari huwezi kuangalia.

327
00:18:13,999 --> 00:18:18,999
Ndiyo. Kwa hiyo, daima huwa nimeichaji tayari.

328
00:18:19,022 --> 00:18:23,189
Una betri ngapi za simu ya mkononi?

329
00:18:23,212 --> 00:18:26,345
Mimi nina tatu.

330
00:18:26,368 --> 00:18:30,970
Tatu? Una nyingi!

331
00:18:30,993 --> 00:18:37,044
Ndiyo. Pia ninatumia kifaa cha kupunguza joto kwa sababu ya simu na kipaza joto kidogo.

332
00:18:37,068 --> 00:18:41,350
Wakati wa kiangazi, kipaza joto ni muhimu sana.

333
00:18:41,373 --> 00:18:45,540
Ee. Haina kazi kwa sababu haitumii kiyoyozi.

334
00:18:45,563 --> 00:18:50,496
Nina betri ya simu moja ya mkono.

335
00:18:50,519 --> 00:18:53,929
Je, betri ina asilimia mia moja?

336
00:18:53,953 --> 00:18:58,119
Hapana, sasa haipaki.

337
00:18:58,142 --> 00:19:00,316
Hiyo si nzuri.

338
00:19:00,340 --> 00:19:03,427
Leo, pakia ili iwe tayari.

339
00:19:03,450 --> 00:19:07,850
Ndiyo, nitapakia mara moja nikirudi nyumbani.

340
00:19:07,873 --> 00:19:13,407
Isipokuwa umeme, unahitaji nini zaidi?

341
00:19:13,430 --> 00:19:17,563
Eeeh, taa ya mkono ndiyo.

342
00:19:17,586 --> 00:19:19,553
Ndiyo.

343
00:19:19,576 --> 00:19:22,242
Usiku huwa giza sana.

344
00:19:22,265 --> 00:19:27,398
Nitainunua betri nyingi za taa ya mkono pia.

345
00:19:27,421 --> 00:19:29,055
Nzuri sana.

346
00:19:29,078 --> 00:19:31,711
Je, wakati wa baridi nini?

347
00:19:31,734 --> 00:19:36,534
Kama umeme utakosekana wakati wa baridi, huwa baridi mno.

348
00:19:36,557 --> 00:19:41,173
Ndiyo. Nitakuwa na nguo za kupotea na blanketi tayari.

349
00:19:41,197 --> 00:19:45,065
Mimi nitanunua pia kairo.

350
00:19:45,089 --> 00:19:47,627
Hiyo ni wazo zuri sana.

351
00:19:47,650 --> 00:19:51,617
Friji ikikwama, unafanya nini?

352
00:19:51,640 --> 00:19:55,840
Nitakula haraka vyakula vilivyomo ndani ya friji.

353
00:19:55,863 --> 00:19:57,596
Ndiyo, ni hivi.

354
00:19:57,619 --> 00:20:01,031
Kwa sababu chakula kitaharibika.

355
00:20:01,055 --> 00:20:04,188
Umeme ni muhimu sana, kweli.

356
00:20:04,211 --> 00:20:09,493
Ndiyo. Kabla ya tetemeko la ardhi, ni vizuri kuwa na maandalizi mbalimbali.

357
00:20:09,517 --> 00:20:12,211
Tujihadhari pamoja.

358
00:20:12,234 --> 00:20:13,734
Sehemu ya 9: Bahari na Hatari za Tsunami / Uzuri na Hatari za Bahari: Tsunami

359
00:20:13,734 --> 00:20:16,502
Bahari ni nzuri sana, sivyo?

360
00:20:16,525 --> 00:20:19,858
Ndiyo, ni nzuri mno.

361
00:20:19,881 --> 00:20:22,764
Napenda bahari.

362
00:20:22,787 --> 00:20:24,962
Mimi pia napenda.

363
00:20:24,986 --> 00:20:28,619
Lakini wakati wa tetemeko la ardhi, ni hatari.

364
00:20:28,642 --> 00:20:30,461
Kwa nini?

365
00:20:30,485 --> 00:20:32,904
Kwa sababu tsunami inakuja.

366
00:20:32,927 --> 00:20:34,894
Tsunami?

367
00:20:34,917 --> 00:20:38,317
Ndiyo, mawimbi makubwa sana.

368
00:20:38,340 --> 00:20:40,306
Kweli?

369
00:20:40,329 --> 00:20:44,696
Ndiyo, mawimbi makubwa na ya kasi sana.

370
00:20:44,719 --> 00:20:47,392
Hiyo ni ya kutisha.

371
00:20:47,415 --> 00:20:53,249
Ndiyo. Kwa hiyo, baada ya tetemeko la ardhi, usiende baharini.

372
00:20:53,272 --> 00:20:55,110
Sawa, nimeelewa.

373
00:20:55,133 --> 00:20:57,346
Mto je?

374
00:20:57,370 --> 00:20:59,624
Mto pia ni hatari.

375
00:20:59,647 --> 00:21:02,381
Usiende mtoni pia.

376
00:21:02,404 --> 00:21:04,051
Haya, ninaelewa.

377
00:21:04,074 --> 00:21:07,041
Basi, nitakimbilia wapi?

378
00:21:07,064 --> 00:21:09,664
Kimbilia mahali pa juu.

379
00:21:09,687 --> 00:21:12,020
Pale pa juu, sivyo?

380
00:21:12,043 --> 00:21:14,610
Kwa mfano, ni wapi?

381
00:21:14,633 --> 00:21:17,470
Jengo refu au mlima.

382
00:21:17,493 --> 00:21:19,186
Sawa, nimeelewa.

383
00:21:19,210 --> 00:21:21,844
Nakimbia kwa haraka?

384
00:21:21,867 --> 00:21:24,633
Ndiyo, kimbia mara moja.

385
00:21:24,656 --> 00:21:27,790
Mizigo je?

386
00:21:27,813 --> 00:21:30,979
Je, unachukua begi la dharura?

387
00:21:31,002 --> 00:21:33,686
Hapana, usichukue chochote.

388
00:21:33,709 --> 00:21:37,243
Eeh, bila kitu nitakwama.

389
00:21:37,266 --> 00:21:40,799
Lakini mwili wako ni muhimu zaidi.

390
00:21:40,822 --> 00:21:44,029
Sawa. Nimeelewa.

391
00:21:44,053 --> 00:21:48,137
Karibu na pwani, kuna bango la onyo la tsunami.

392
00:21:48,160 --> 00:21:50,371
Bango la namna gani?

393
00:21:50,394 --> 00:21:53,649
Bango la tahadhari ya tsunami.

394
00:21:53,673 --> 00:21:57,606
Aa, huko ndipo bango hilo liko.

395
00:21:57,629 --> 00:21:59,837
Ndiyo, ndivyo.

396
00:21:59,861 --> 00:22:02,906
Je, kuna mabango mengine?

397
00:22:02,929 --> 00:22:06,005
Ndiyo, kuna bango la buluu pia.

398
00:22:06,028 --> 00:22:08,562
Bango la buluu ni la nini?

399
00:22:08,585 --> 00:22:11,218
Bango la mahali pa kujiokoa.

400
00:22:11,241 --> 00:22:13,374
Mahali pa kujificha?

401
00:22:13,397 --> 00:22:16,964
Ndiyo, ni mahali ambapo watu hukimbilia.

402
00:22:16,987 --> 00:22:19,962
Huko kwenye bango la buluu, ndiyo?

403
00:22:19,985 --> 00:22:23,678
Ndiyo. Hicho ni mahali salama.

404
00:22:23,702 --> 00:22:28,268
Nikiwa ninapopita karibu na pwani, daima naangalia mabango.

405
00:22:28,291 --> 00:22:31,225
Ndiyo, kuwa makini.

406
00:22:31,248 --> 00:22:32,748
Sehemu ya 10: Kujifunza Kanji kwa Kutumia Programu za Habari / Learning Kanji with News Apps

407
00:22:32,748 --> 00:22:36,081
Unaangalia simu yako, sivyo?

408
00:22:36,104 --> 00:22:38,471
Unafanya nini?

409
00:22:38,494 --> 00:22:42,305
Ninasoma habari za Kijapani.

410
00:22:42,328 --> 00:22:46,294
Lakini kanji ni ngumu.

411
00:22:46,317 --> 00:22:48,727
Habari za tetemeko la ardhi?

412
00:22:48,751 --> 00:22:51,784
Ndiyo, ndivyo.

413
00:22:51,807 --> 00:22:55,266
Ninataka kusoma habari za tetemeko la ardhi la asubuhi hii.

414
00:22:55,289 --> 00:23:00,100
Basi, naweza kukujulisha programu nzuri?

415
00:23:00,124 --> 00:23:01,858
Programu?

416
00:23:01,881 --> 00:23:04,335
Programu ya aina gani?

417
00:23:04,358 --> 00:23:08,325
Programu ya habari na hali ya hewa.

418
00:23:08,348 --> 00:23:11,353
Je, ni programu ya Japani?

419
00:23:11,376 --> 00:23:15,043
Ndiyo, ndivyo.

420
00:23:15,066 --> 00:23:17,444
Ni programu ya NHK ya dharura.

421
00:23:17,467 --> 00:23:20,082
NHK, ndiyo.

422
00:23:20,106 --> 00:23:22,987
Ninawaona mara kwa mara kwenye televisheni.

423
00:23:23,011 --> 00:23:26,786
Programu hii ni ya manufaa sana.

424
00:23:26,809 --> 00:23:29,264
Kwa nini ni ya manufaa?

425
00:23:29,288 --> 00:23:33,365
Unaweza kusoma habari kwa lugha za kigeni.

426
00:23:33,388 --> 00:23:36,022
Aa, kweli?

427
00:23:36,045 --> 00:23:37,724
Sawa.

428
00:23:37,747 --> 00:23:41,617
Kuna Kiingereza na lugha za nchi nyingine.

429
00:23:41,641 --> 00:23:45,308
Je, kuna lugha ya nchi yangu?

430
00:23:45,331 --> 00:23:50,697
Ndiyo, kuna lugha nyingi, basi hakuna matatizo.

431
00:23:50,720 --> 00:23:52,954
Hiyo ni nzuri.

432
00:23:52,977 --> 00:23:56,210
Niruhusu nikuonyeshe simu yangu.

433
00:23:56,233 --> 00:23:58,433
Hii ndiyo.

434
00:23:58,456 --> 00:24:01,223
Aa, kweli ndivyo.

435
00:24:01,246 --> 00:24:05,012
Ninaweza kusoma kwa lugha ya nchi yangu.

436
00:24:05,035 --> 00:24:06,904
Ndiyo.

437
00:24:06,928 --> 00:24:11,928
Wakati wa tetemeko kubwa la ardhi, taarifa huja mara moja.

438
00:24:11,951 --> 00:24:15,006
Hiyo ni salama sana.

439
00:24:15,030 --> 00:24:19,231
Unaweza kuona ramani ya mahali pa kujiokoa pia.

440
00:24:19,255 --> 00:24:22,426
Ramani ya mahali pa kukimbilia, ndiyo?

441
00:24:22,450 --> 00:24:24,819
Ni ya manufaa sana.

442
00:24:24,842 --> 00:24:26,417
Sawa.

443
00:24:26,441 --> 00:24:29,459
Unaweza kuona tahadhari za tsunami pia.

444
00:24:29,482 --> 00:24:35,049
Nilikuwa nikisumbuliwa kidogo kwa sababu sikuelewi maneno mengi.

445
00:24:35,072 --> 00:24:39,605
Kwa kuwa programu hii ipo, sasa ni salama.

446
00:24:39,628 --> 00:24:42,807
Ninapenda programu hiyo pia.

447
00:24:42,830 --> 00:24:47,109
Basi, tuanze kuitumia sasa hivi?

448
00:24:47,133 --> 00:24:49,299
Ndiyo, tafadhali.

449
00:24:49,322 --> 00:24:52,089
Je, inahitaji pesa?

450
00:24:52,112 --> 00:24:55,888
Hapana, haitahitaji pesa.

451
00:24:55,911 --> 00:24:57,845
Ni bure kabisa.

452
00:24:57,868 --> 00:24:59,714
Ni vizuri kusikia.

453
00:24:59,737 --> 00:25:02,337
Nitaingiza vipi?

454
00:25:02,360 --> 00:25:04,859
Nitafanya kwa ajili yako.

455
00:25:04,883 --> 00:25:07,450
Tafadhali, nipe smarthphone yako.

456
00:25:07,473 --> 00:25:10,039
Ndiyo, asante sana.

457
00:25:10,062 --> 00:25:12,396
Imekwisha.

458
00:25:12,419 --> 00:25:15,152
Fungua programu hii.

459
00:25:15,175 --> 00:25:17,042
Sawa.

460
00:25:17,065 --> 00:25:20,498
Aa, imebadilika kwa lugha yangu!

461
00:25:20,521 --> 00:25:22,696
Vizuri sana!

462
00:25:22,719 --> 00:25:26,052
Nimepata programu nzuri kutoka kwako.

463
00:25:26,075 --> 00:25:28,675
Asante sana kwa kweli.

464
00:25:28,698 --> 00:25:33,698
Hapana, angalia habari kila siku, unaelewa?

465
00:25:33,721 --> 00:25:36,321
Ndiyo, nitazifanya.